  "description": "<p>This task is to either remove the link under \"Other Resources\" on individual Mementos; or better yet, to change it back to the previous functionality of linking to hash resources of the Memento.</p>\n\n<p>To reproduce in the HTML UI:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>create a resource</li>\n\t<li>create a version of the resource</li>\n\t<li>view an individual memento</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Observe a link under \"Other Resources\" that contains the title or URL of the original resource.</p>",
